{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0550"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge geography/cities","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/geography__cities.g3.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",716],["+","Auckland, the country's only city with more than a million inhabitants, lies farther north on the same island. "],["=",20],["-","capitals,"],["+","capitals.\n\nThe"],["=",1],["+","southernmost cities of all lie in South America, on the shores of the Strait of Magellan "],["=",2],["+","the Beagle Channel. "],["=",4],["-","or"],["+","in"],["=",1],["+","Chile, at 53 degrees south, was settled by Chile in 1848 as a colony on the strait and grew rich as a coaling station for ships rounding the continent before the Panama Canal opened. With more than 100,000 inhabitants it is the largest city south of the 46th parallel and today a gateway for Antarctic expeditions. "],["=",2],["-","are"],["+","in"],["=",1],["+","Argentina lies "],["=",8],["-","far"],["+","is"],["=",1],["-","smaller."],["+","somewhat smaller, so the two towns have argued for decades over which deserves the title of southernmost city in the world."],["=",354],["+","\n| largest city south of 46° S | Punta Arenas | Chile | 53.2° S |"],["=",52]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",670],["+","Auckland, die einzige Millionenstadt des Landes, liegt weiter nördlich auf derselben Insel. "],["=",18],["-","Hauptstädte,"],["+","Hauptstädte.\n\nDie"],["=",1],["+","südlichsten Städte überhaupt liegen in Südamerika, an der Magellanstraße "],["=",2],["+","am Beagle-Kanal. "],["=",4],["-","oder"],["+","in"],["=",1],["+","Chile, auf 53 Grad Süd, wurde 1848 von Chile als Kolonie an der Meerenge besiedelt und wurde als Kohlestation für Schiffe reich, die den Kontinent umrundeten, bevor der Panamakanal eröffnet wurde. Mit mehr als 100.000 Einwohnern ist es die größte Stadt südlich des 46. Breitengrads und heute ein Ausgangspunkt für Antarktis-Expeditionen. "],["=",2],["-","liegen"],["+","in"],["=",1],["+","Argentinien liegt "],["=",2],["-","südlicher,"],["+","weiter"],["=",1],["-","sind"],["+","südlich,"],["=",1],["+","ist "],["=",2],["-","weit"],["+","etwas"],["=",1],["-","kleiner."],["+","kleiner, und so streiten beide Orte seit Jahrzehnten darüber, wem der Titel der südlichsten Stadt der Welt gebührt."],["=",328],["+","\n| größte Stadt südlich von 46° S | Punta Arenas | Chile | 53,2° S |"],["=",46]]}]},
